Hello,
This is a warning, not an error. For species GEOFFROY, bandwidth estimation (of the kernel density) failed. This usually happens when there are too few records, or multiple records are at the same time.

I doubt this has to do with the date format. It's just that the data for species may not be suitable for density estimation.

If you have multiple records at different times and still get that error please provide a reproducible example.

Thank you,
Jürgen

