Dr. Niedballa,

You have helped me in the past to have the recordTable
summarize certain columns (you included two new arguments in a workaround
function; eventSummaryColumn & event SummaryFunction to determine
Count_max, the maximum amount of individuals of one species observed during a
given delta).  Thank you for this!  I am now investigating passage of animals
through wildlife crossings (underpasses).
My goal is to determine if an individual or individuals enter(s) one
side of the crossing and then exit(s) on the other side during a certain
timeframe.  It would be incredibly
helpful to have an additional column that summarizes the max count of animals
that completed a passage event from one side to the other, given criteria for
their motion (activity related to entering or exiting the crossing).  If this is something that you would be able
to offer insight for, then I can provide additional details for the argument,
along with a small sample dataset to your email.

I appreciate your feedback and direction for this!

-Michelle

